harvesting rainwater can help with what project areas,"['https://ethicons.com/?url=blog%2Fprivacy-policy%2F', 'http://haryali.org/our-activities/water-harvesting-save-life/', 'http://www.pumpsncontrols.com/types-of-water-harvesting.html', 'http://akinbacioglu.com/12584.html', 'https://ralandscaping.com/what-is-a-rainwater-harvesting/', 'http://sgwatertech.com/S-E-C/', 'http://www.peacefmonline.com/pages/local/news/201403/194765.php']","Rainwater harvesting is the accumulation and storage of rainwater for reuse on-site, rather than allowing it to run off. Rainwater can be collected from rivers or roofs, and in many places, the water collected is redirected to a deep pit (well, shaft, or borehole), a reservoir with percolation, or collected from dew or fog with nets or other tools. Its uses include water for gardens, livestock, irrigation, domestic use with proper treatment, indoor heating for houses, etc. The harvested water can also be used as drinking water, longer-term storage, and for other purposes such as groundwater recharge.","This Page Does Not Exist This Page Does Not Exist Sorry, the page you are looking for could not be found. It's just an accident that was not intentional. [SEP_DOC] global water solution :: Water Softener, Kirloskar Water Pump, CRI Industrial Pump, Automatic Pump Controller Supplier, Provider, Distributors, Traders, Authorized Dealer in Panvel, Near me, Mumbai, Navi Mumbai, Thane Sitemap What We Offer We provide complete Water Solutions for Lands, Residentials and Comercials water pumps. Enquire Now Get Product KOSi Openwell Submersible Pump SPM Kirloskar Self Priming Pump Mini 50s - Mini Family Kirloskar Mini Water Pump KDS+ Kirloskar End Suction Monobloc Pump JVS Vertical openwell submersible pump( three phase) MCB Control Panel Three Phase Control Panel SS Sensor Water Level Controller Single Phase Control Panel Mobi-1 Mobile Starter Mobile Auto Switch DB Utility End Suction Pump Industrial RO Standard Industrial Water Treatment SPD S