1) Use scientific terms when explaining the functions of metabolism
2) Explain the chemical changes that occur in aerobic and anaerobic respiration.
3) Identify the products of aerobic respiration by carrying out laboratory experiments
4) Describe and illustrate the energy and matter changes that occur during aerobic respiration and the identify the location in the cell which these changes occur.
