why does the leonid meteor shower always seem to radiate from the constellation leo,"['https://awakeningwithplanetearth.com/2016/12/02/what-martians-love-the-song-of-the-leonids-the-wisdom-of-the-elohim-by-alice-b-clagett/', 'https://wikimili.com/en/Space_environment', 'http://astroloversky.blogspot.com/2009/06/2001-leonids-meteor-shower.html', 'http://archive.seattleastro.org/webfoot/nov99/pg2.htm', 'https://www.donegalweatherchannel.ie/meteor-showers/', 'http://www.bc-team.org/proj/gregarius/feed.php?channel=32', 'https://myspaceexperience.com/experience/leonid-meteor-shower/']","The Leonids (/ ˈliːənɪdz / LEE-ə-nidz) are a prolific meteor shower associated with the comet Tempel -- Tuttle. The Leonids get their name from the location of their radiant in the constellation Leo: the meteors appear to radiate from that point in the sky. Their proper Greek name should be Leontids (Λεοντίδαι, Leontídai), but the word was initially constructed as a Greek / Latin hybrid and it has been used since. They peak in the month of November.","Page not found | AWAKENING WITH PLANET EARTH It seems we can’t find what you’re looking for. Perhaps searching can help. Search for: Subscribe to Blog via Email Enter your email address to subscribe to this blog and receive notifications of new posts by email. Email Address Subscribe BLOG STATS792,719 hits SEARCH NEWEST POSTS Whatever a Man Sows, That Shall He Reap . by Alice B. Clagett 3 May 2026 Christian Prayer to Protect Your Home from Those Evil Spirits of Treachery, Greed, or Seduction That Attempt to Sow Seeds of Sorrow or Discontent There . by Alice B. Clagett 28 April 2026 Compendium: When Threatened by Barang or Kulam Black Magic, Counter with Christian Prayer . by Alice B. Clagett * 27 April 2026 In General: Standard Christian Prayers That Protect People from Barang or Kulam . by Alice B. Clagett 27 April 2026 Barang or Kulam: Black Magic Using Animals . by Alice B. Clagett 27 April 2026 Barang or Kulam: Black Magic Curses on Othe