UNCLE DREW plot:
Dax (Lil Rel Howery) convinces former basketball playground legend Uncle Drew (Kyrie Irving) to join a streetball tournament at the Rucker Park in Harlem after losing his basketball team to his rival Mookie (Nick Kroll). Uncle Drew agrees but as one of the conditions, he will have to form his own team. The two set out on a road trip to pick up Drew’s old basketball squad.
