where did the don't tread on me flag originate,"['https://patriotsforamericausa.com/2017/09/07/the-gadsden-flag-a-symbol-of-american-independence/', 'http://patriotic-flags.com/index.php?main_page=product_info&products_id=875', 'https://www.deviantart.com/pixelworlds/art/Gadsden-Flag-Animation-148778523', 'https://www.pathtags.com/community/tag.php?id=11408', 'https://ladylibertyflag.com/shop/gadsden-flag-dont-tread-on-me-flag/', 'https://www.stripersonline.com/surftalk/topic/731523-%E2%80%9Cjoin-or-die%E2%80%9D-in-ca/?page=1', 'https://www.flagsexpress.com/product_p/gadsden-flag.htm']","Those first ships were used to intercept incoming British ships carrying war supplies to the British troops in the colonies to both deprive the supplies to the British and to supply to the Continental Army. One ship captured by Captain John Manley had 30,000 pairs of shoes on it. However, the admiralty agent demanded his 2 1 / 2 per cent commission before he would release the cargo for Washington's army, so many soldiers marched barefoot in the snow. To aid in this, the Second Continental Congress authorized the mustering of five companies of Marines to accompany the Navy on their first mission. The first Marines enlisted in the city of Philadelphia, and they carried drums painted yellow, depicting a coiled rattlesnake with thirteen rattles, and the motto ""Don't Tread on Me."" This is the first recorded mention of the future Gadsden flag's symbolism.","ERROR: The request could not be satisfied 403 ERROR The request could not be satisfied. Request blocked. We can't connect to the server for this app or website at this time. There might be too much traffic or a configuration error. Try again later, or contact the app or website owner. If you provide content to customers through CloudFront, you can find steps to troubleshoot and help prevent this error by reviewing the CloudFront documentation. Generated by cloudfront (CloudFront) Request ID: PZbRx9BkIJpkGN0xRR0r0Nru0g7-cYhvRDFWDnf0Z7