Joe Kennedy Sr., John Fitzgerald Kennedy's Father and the Patriarch of ""America's Royal Family,"" left behind a Complicated Legacy. He was a Prominent United States Businessman and Political Figure. The father also of Senators Robert F. Kennedy and Edward M. Kennedy. He was a Leading Member of the Democratic Party and of the Irish Catholic Community. With Nationwide Business Interests and Political Connections, Joe Kennedy worked behind the Scenes in his Last Decades to continue building both the Financial and Political Fortunes of the Kennedy Family while furthering his Own Political Ambitions through his Sons....
