I liked this project so much. Nancy has the role of teaching us and inspiring us all the time. She put in long extra hours to train us to give our best, so thank a Nancy for the investment of time. I think our performance was something more than just theatro. During this project I met a lot of new people, I will remember this EVS, I had improved my English skills and acting. I had learned how to solve problems,..that there are always some people that can help me. Greece is very nice country and it was a pleasure for me to be there.
