This whole thing is about the Kalamata Street Festival EVS Project, I am sure you know all about it, and in case you don't just Google it. I had a lot of fun before, during and after the project, but I will talk about the part during the project. Spending time with people of different cultures and exploring the culture of Greece was an awesome experience for me. I am 1/8-th greek, so I also explored a part of my own heritage. Before the festival, we had a lot of work to do and things to plan, but it was a lot of fun, even though a bit hectic. The festival itself was very nice, even though 75% of it was canceled. #NikasMalaka
