East Valley Living owners, Kathleen Forden and Kathleen Gorden operate several businesses in the East Valley area. The concept for EVLiving. com - Your Guide to the East Valley, materialized after evaluating the Phoenix-Mesa (East Valley) metropolitan areas of Arizona, and determining the need for a comprehensive resource guide to represent the communities in which they live and work.
Â“We knew early on, that health issues were going to be a hot topic for the community. We sought out some of the finest East Valley business professionals to fill the hunger the community has for health and fitness information,Â” said Publisher and Editor, Kathleen Forden.
