Mike Masood's latest article on the patterns of the fitness cycle educates the community about how easily people tend to fall out of training routines and why: http://www. evliving. com/asktrain. php? action=fullnews&showcomments=1&id=1990 (http://www. evliving. com/asktrain. php? action=fullnews&showcomments=1&id=1990)
