One of Lance's latest weekly health articles is on the topic of defensive cancer prevention that has proven to be an invaluable source of information to the worldwide Internet audience who are researching cancer and cancer treatment:
Http://www. evliving. com/drfittalks. php? action=fullnews&showcomments=1&id=1483 (http://www. evliving. com/drfittalks. php? action=fullnews&showcomments=1&id=1483)
