Each week, Agnes Oblas, addresses questions submitted on medical and general health issues. Her latest answer to a TB test question is just one sample of Agnes' easy to understand answers to general medical questions: http://www. evliving. com/medqanda. php? action=fullnews&showcomments=1&id=1910 (http://www. evliving. com/medqanda. php? action=fullnews&showcomments=1&id=1910)
